##### Introduction to Python

1.  Python is a general purpose , high level programming language known for its easy syntax and readability.

2.  It is used in data analytics, data science, machine learning, web design, automation, artificial intelligence etc.

3.  It was invented by Guido van Rossum in the year 1991.

##### Why do we need Python?

Python is needed because

(a.)    we can easily code huge and complex code in simple lines.

(b.)    we can easily read the codes and understand it easily.

(c.)    It can be used in the field of data analytics, data science, machine learning applications, web design etc.

(d.)    We can easily automate the repetative tasks very easily.